-box I'm told that over the last  three years I've answered over 4,500  questions over 140 hours in this house  more more than I might have expected mr.  speaker  in future I look forward to asking the  questions but we are as the right  honorable lady has said living through  extraordinary political times this House  of Commons is rightly at the center of  those events and that's because of the  vital link between every single member  of this house and the communities the  Commons that we represent that's the  bedrock of our parliamentary democracy  and of our Liberty and each one of us  wherever we sit whatever we stand for  can take pride in that and that duty to  serve my constituents will remain my  greatest motivation  [Music]  [Applause]
 

